  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining System Architecture**\n\nI\'m currently focused on designing the Institute Management System\'s fundamental architecture and modular structure. My goal is to carefully review all required schemas, models, algorithms, and interfaces, ensuring a robust and efficient system design. I\'m starting with the data models, specifically the Institute schema, as the foundation.\n\n\n**Outlining Key Entities**\n\nI\'ve moved on from the broad architectural strokes and am now deep-diving into the core entities and their attributes. I\'ve fleshed out the data models for the Institute, User, TeacherProfile, StudentProfile, ParentProfile, Course, Subject, Batch, BatchSubjectTeacher, TimetableSlot, AttendanceSession, AttendanceRecord, Test, and TestResult, adding detailed attributes and relationships to capture all necessary data points.\n\n\n**Detailing Additional Modules**\n\nI\'m now expanding the data model to encompass homework, fees, and performance tracking. Specifically, I\'m defining Homework, FeeStructure, PerformanceAlert, ImprovementPlan, StudentRemark, Notice, and Notification entities. I\'m also ensuring all relationships are properly defined to create a holistic view of the institute\'s operations and student progress.\n\n\n**Defining Diagnostics & Alerts**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the diagnostic calculations and alerts. I\'ve defined thresholds for low attendance (75%) and academic drop (15%), along with a homework limit (3 consecutive misses). I\'ve crafted the structure for `computeStudentDiagnostics`, including student ID, averages, attendance, weaknesses, strengths, flags (attendance, academic drop, homework, chronic weakness with severity), and automated recommendations. I\'m focusing on providing useful and actionable information.\n\n\n**Mapping Persona Views**\n\nI\'ve been thinking about the user interface components. I am planning components such as `FastAttendanceGrid` for attendance, and `BadgeShowcase` for displaying badges. I\'m moving toward the various persona views with subpages, focusing on a Role Switcher and Persona Bar for Super Admin, Admin, Teacher, Student, and Parent. I\'m also considering a mobile app simulation view, rendering specific screen layouts for both desktop and mobile applications, which would be extremely useful for comprehensive testing. I\'ll need to use `/src/types/ims.ts` to manage all types.\n\n\n**Defining Engine Functionality**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the diagnostic engine and mock data. I\'m building out `/src/services/analyticsEngine.ts` to compute at-risk flags, subject weak spots, class deltas, and automated recommendations. I\'m also preparing `/src/data/mockData.ts` with interconnected datasets for testing. React state management in `/src/context/IMSContext.tsx` is providing state for active role and user personas, full state management, and actions such as `markAttendance`, `createTest`, `enterMarks`, `createHomework`, `submitHomework`, `gradeHomework`, `collectFee`, and `createImprovementPlan`. I\'m using TypeScript interfaces, enums, and mock data contracts.\n\n\n**Defining UI Components**\n\nI\'m now deep into designing UI components. I\'ve been working on: `StatCard.tsx`, `PerformanceTrendChart.tsx`, `AttendanceHeatmap.tsx`, `AtRiskBadge.tsx`, `BadgeShowcase.tsx`, `TopHeader.tsx`, and `Sidebar.tsx`. I\'m also focusing on key interactions like `FastAttendanceGrid.tsx` for attendance and `GradebookSheet.tsx` for grades, plus SuperAdmin dashboards. I\'m focusing on responsiveness and user-friendliness.\n\n\n**Developing Persona Views**\n\nI\'m now expanding the persona views with specific components. I\'m focusing on `AdminView.tsx` with operations dashboards and directory functions, `TeacherView.tsx` including workspace schedule and gradebook, `StudentView.tsx` with performance tracking and submission tools, and `ParentView.tsx` offering ward overviews and communications. I\'m also planning `/src/components/mobile/MobilePreviewModal.tsx` for mobile screen simulations.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_42665"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"export type Role = \'SUPER_ADMIN\' | \'ADMIN\' | \'TEACHER\' | \'STUDENT\' | \'PARENT\';\\n\\nexport type Gender = \'MALE\' | \'FEMALE\' | \'OTHER\';\\n\\nexport type AttendanceStatus = \'PRESENT\' | \'ABSENT\' | \'LATE\' | \'EXCUSED\';\\n\\nexport type PaymentStatus = \'PAID\' | \'PARTIAL\' | \'DUE\' | \'OVERDUE\';\\n\\nexport type SubmissionStatus = \'PENDING\' | \'SUBMITTED\' | \'LATE\' | \'EVALUATED\';\\n\\nexport type SeverityLevel = \'LOW\' | \'MEDIUM\' | \'HIGH\' | \'CRITICAL\';\\n\\nexport interface Institute {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  code: string;\\n  address?: string;\\n  phone?: string;\\n  email: string;\\n  logoUrl?: string;\\n  campusCount: number;\\n  totalStudents: number;\\n  totalFaculty: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface User {\\n  id: string;\\n  instituteId: string;\\n  email: string;\\n  role: Role;\\n  firstName: string;\\n  lastName: string;\\n  phone?: string;\\n  avatarUrl?: string;\\n  isActive: boolean;\\n  title?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface TeacherProfile {\\n  id: string;\\n  userId: string;\\n  employeeCode: string;\\n  qualification: string;\\n  specialization: string;\\n  joiningDate: string;\\n  workloadHoursPerWeek: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ParentProfile {\\n  id: string;\\n  userId: string;\\n  occupation: string;\\n  childrenIds: string[]; // studentProfile ids\\n}\\n\\nexport interface StudentProfile {\\n  id: string;\\n  userId: string;\\n  parentId?: string;\\n  batchId: string;\\n  rollNumber: string;\\n  admissionNumber: string;\\n  admissionDate: string;\\n  dateOfBirth?: string;\\n  gender: Gender;\\n  bloodGroup?: string;\\n  address?: string;\\n  currentStreak: number;\\n  highestStreak: number;\\n  badgePoints: number;\\n  gradeLevel: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Course {\\n  id: string;\\n  instituteId: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  code: string;\\n  description?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Subject {\\n  id: string;\\n  courseId: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  code: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Batch {\\n  id: string;\\n  instituteId: string;\\n  courseId: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  startDate: string;\\n  endDate?: string;\\n  maxCapacity: number;\\n  enrolledCount: number;\\n  roomNumber?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface TimetableSlot {\\n  id: string;\\n  batchId: string;\\n  dayOfWeek: number; // 1 = Monday, 5 = Friday\\n  startTime: string;\\n  endTime: string;\\n  subjectName: string;\\n  teacherName: string;\\n  classroom: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AttendanceRecord {\\n  id: string;\\n  sessionId: string;\\n  studentId: string;\\n  status: AttendanceStatus;\\n  remarks?: string;\\n  date: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AttendanceSession {\\n  id: string;\\n  batchId: string;\\n  date: string;\\n  takenById: string;\\n  records: AttendanceRecord[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Test {\\n  id: string;\\n  batchId: string;\\n  subjectId: string;\\n  subjectName: string;\\n  teacherId: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  maxMarks: number;\\n  passingMarks: number;\\n  testDate: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface TestResult {\\n  id: string;\\n  testId: string;\\n  studentId: string;\\n  marksObtained: number;\\n  percentile?: number;\\n  remarks?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Homework {\\n  id: string;\\n  batchId: string;\\n  subjectId: string;\\n  subjectName: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  description: string;\\n  dueDate: string;\\n  totalSubmissions: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface HomeworkSubmission {\\n  id: string;\\n  homeworkId: string;\\n  studentId: string;\\n  submissionDate: string;\\n  fileUrl?: string;\\n  fileName?: string;\\n  status: SubmissionStatus;\\n  grade?: string;\\n  score?: number;\\n  feedback?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface FeeInvoice {\\n  id: string;\\n  studentId: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  amount: number;\\n  paidAmount: number;\\n  dueDate: string;\\n  status: PaymentStatus;\\n  receiptNumber?: string;\\n  paymentMethod?: string;\\n  paidDate?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PerformanceAlert {\\n  id: string;\\n  studentId: string;\\n  studentName: string;\\n  batchName: string;\\n  category: \'ATTENDANCE\' | \'ACADEMIC_DROP\' | \'HOMEWORK\' | \'CHRONIC_WEAKNESS\';\\n  title: string;\\n  message: string;\\n  severity: SeverityLevel;\\n  isResolved: boolean;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ImprovementPlanTask {\\n  id: string;\\n  planId: string;\\n  assignedById: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  isDone: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ImprovementPlan {\\n  id: string;\\n  studentId: string;\\n  studentName: string;\\n  subjectName: string;\\n  focusArea: string;\\n  targetScore: number;\\n  deadline: string;\\n  status: \'IN_PROGRESS\' | \'COMPLETED\' | \'OVERDUE\';\\n  tasks: ImprovementPlanTask[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface StudentRemark {\\n  id: string;\\n  studentId: string;\\n  authorName: string;\\n  authorRole: string;\\n  category: string;\\n  comment: string;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Notice {\\n  id: string;\\n  instituteId: string;\\n  authorId: string;\\n  authorName: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  content: string;\\n  targetRole?: Role | \'ALL\';\\n  priority: \'NORMAL\' | \'HIGH\' | \'EMERGENCY\';\\n  createdAt: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Badge {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  earnedAt: string;\\n  icon: string;\\n  description: string;\\n  category: \'ATTENDANCE\' | \'ACADEMIC\' | \'HOMEWORK\' | \'LEADERSHIP\';\\n  points: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AuditLog {\\n  id: string;\\n  timestamp: string;\\n  userId: string;\\n  userName: string;\\n  action: string;\\n  entity: string;\\n  details: string;\\n  ipAddress: string;\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create complete TypeScript types for IMS matching Prisma schema and architecture\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/types/ims.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating IMS types\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create types for IMS\"}"
