dynamics & Reaction Velocity Formulations\',\n    targetScore: 85,\n    deadline: \'2024-11-20\',\n    status: \'IN_PROGRESS\',\n    tasks: [\n      { id: \'task-1\', planId: \'plan-01\', assignedById: \'tp-02\', title: \'Complete Arrhenius Equation Drill Set A (15 problems)\', isDone: true },\n      { id: \'task-2\', planId: \'plan-01\', assignedById: \'tp-02\', title: \'Attend Tuesday After-School Kinetics Clinic with Dr. Rostova\', isDone: true },\n      { id: \'task-3\', planId: \'plan-01\', assignedById: \'tp-02\', title: \'Submit 5-page Equilibrium Constant lab report review\', isDone: false },\n      { id: \'task-4\', planId: \'plan-01\', assignedById: \'tp-02\', title: \'Sit for Retake Diagnostic Module 3B\', isDone: false }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'plan-02\',\n    studentId: \'sp-03\',\n    studentName: \'Rohan Mehta\',\n    subjectName: \'Mathematics: Differential Calculus\',\n    focusArea: \'Foundational Limits & Chain Rule Mastery\',\n    targetScore: 65,\n    deadline: \'2024-11-15\',\n    status: \'IN_PROGRESS\',\n    tasks: [\n      { id: \'task-201\', planId: \'plan-02\', assignedById: \'tp-01\', title: \'Mandatory parent-teacher conference on attendance schedule\', isDone: false },\n      { id: \'task-202\', planId: \'plan-02\', assignedById: \'tp-01\', title: \'1-on-1 tutoring sessions with faculty assistant (Mon/Wed)\', isDone: false },\n      { id: \'task-203\', planId: \'plan-02\', assignedById: \'tp-01\', title: \'Submit completed remedial problem sets 1 through 4\', isDone: false }\n    ]\n  }\n];\n\nexport const mockStudentRemarks: StudentRemark[] = [\n  {\n    id: \'rem-01\',\n    studentId: \'sp-01\',\n    authorName: \'Prof. Vikram Nair\',\n    authorRole: \'Physics Lead\',\n    category: \'ACADEMIC_EXCELLENCE\',\n    comment: \'Aarav demonstrated graduate-level intuition in solving the rotating frame conservation puzzle. Outstanding dedication.\',\n    createdAt: \'2024-10-21\'\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'rem-02\',\n    studentId: \'sp-01\