  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Header Components**\n\nI\'m now focused on building the `TopHeader.tsx` component, adhering to the strict 3-zone Top Bar contract defined in the `frontend_design` skill. Specifically, I\'m starting with Zone 1, which will house the wordmark, using a single text element with no whitespace wrapping, such as \"IMS \342\200\223 Institute Management System\".\n\n\n**Designing Top Bar Features**\n\nI\'m now integrating Zone 2 and Zone 3 elements into `TopHeader.tsx`. Zone 2 will handle breadcrumbs or concise links, while Zone 3 will include a primary action\342\200\224the Persona Switcher, a mobile simulation trigger, and a dark mode toggle. I\'ve designed an interactive Persona Switcher modal for seamless role switching. Additionally, I\'m working on a \"Mobile App Simulation\" button and Dark Mode toggle.\nI\'m now tackling the role-aware `Sidebar.tsx`, matching the specified pages for each role.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_62064"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\nimport { useIMS } from \'../../context/IMSContext\';\\nimport { Role } from \'../../types/ims\';\\nimport {\\n  Smartphone,\\n  Moon,\\n  Sun,\\n  ChevronDown,\\n  UserCheck,\\n  GraduationCap,\\n  Briefcase,\\n  Users,\\n  ShieldCheck,\\n  Building2\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\ninterface TopHeaderProps {\\n  currentSection: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport const TopHeader: React.FC<TopHeaderProps> = ({ currentSection }) => {\\n  const {\\n    role,\\n    setRole,\\n    currentUser,\\n    isDarkMode,\\n    toggleDarkMode,\\n    isMobilePreviewOpen,\\n    setMobilePreviewOpen,\\n    institute\\n  } = useIMS();\\n\\n  const [isPersonaMenuOpen, setIsPersonaMenuOpen] = useState(false);\\n\\n  const personas: { role: Role; name: string; title: string; icon: any }[] = [\\n    {\\n      role: \'SUPER_ADMIN\',\\n      name: \'Dr. Arvind Sharma\',\\n      title: \'Chancellor & Trustee\',\\n      icon: ShieldCheck\\n    },\\n    {\\n      role: \'ADMIN\',\\n      name: \'Rachel Vance\',\\n      title: \'Operations Director\',\\n      icon: Building2\\n    },\\n    {\\n      role: \'TEACHER\',\\n      name: \'Prof. Vikram Nair\',\\n      title: \'Physics & Calculus Faculty Lead\',\\n      icon: Briefcase\\n    },\\n    {\\n      role: \'STUDENT\',\\n      name: \'Aarav Patel\',\\n      title: \'Grade 11 - STEM Scholar (Roll #1104)\',\\n      icon: GraduationCap\\n    },\\n    {\\n      role: \'PARENT\',\\n      name: \'Meera Patel\',\\n      title: \'Guardian (Parent of Aarav)\',\\n      icon: Users\\n    }\\n  ];\\n\\n  return (\\n    <header className=\\\"sticky top-0 z-30 h-14 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white/95 dark:bg-[#111C44]/95 backdrop-blur px-6 flex items-center justify-between gap-8\\\">\\n      {/* Zone 1: Brand Wordmark */}\\n      <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"/\\\" className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#1E3A8A] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shadow-sm\\\">\\n            IMS\\n          </div>\\n          <span className=\\\"font-bold text-sm tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n            {institute.name}\\n          </span>\\n        </a>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Zone 2: Breadcrumb trail */}\\n      <div className=\\\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 whitespace-nowrap shrink-0\\\">\\n        <span>Portal</span>\\n        <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">/</span>\\n        <span className=\\\"font-medium text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 capitalize\\\">\\n          {role.toLowerCase().replace(\'_\', \' \')}\\n        </span>\\n        <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">/</span>\\n        <span className=\\\"text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 font-semibold\\\">{currentSection}</span>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Zone 3: Actions + Persona Switcher */}\\n      <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0\\\">\\n        {/* Mobile App Simulator Toggle */}\\n        <button\\n          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          onClick={() => setMobilePreviewOpen(!isMobilePreviewOpen)}\\n          className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-lg border transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap ${\\n            isMobilePreviewOpen\\n              ? \'bg-teal-50 border-teal-300 text-teal-800 dark:bg-teal-950/40 dark:border-teal-700 dark:text-teal-300\'\\n              : \'border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\'\\n          }`}\\n          title=\\\"Open simulated React Native / Expo mobile screen\\\"\\n        >\\n          <Smartphone className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400\\\" />\\n          <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline\\\">Mobile Screen Preview</span>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        {/* Dark Mode */}\\n        <button\\n          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          onClick={toggleDarkMode}\\n          className=\\\"p-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors\\\"\\n          title={isDarkMode ? \'Switch to light mode\' : \'Switch to dark mode\'}\\n        >\\n          {isDarkMode ? <Sun className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-400\\\" /> : <Moon className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />}\\n        </button>\\n\\n        {/* Active Persona Dropdown */}\\n        <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={() => setIsPersonaMenuOpen(!isPersonaMenuOpen)}\\n            className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 pl-2 pr-3 py-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-750 transition-colors text-left\\\"\\n          >\\n            <div className=\\\"w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-[#1E3A8A] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold shrink-0\\\">\\n              {currentUser.firstName[0]}\\n              {currentUser.lastName[0]}\\n            </div>\\n            <div className=\\\"hidden lg:block text-left leading-tight\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n                {currentUser.firstName} {currentUser.lastName}\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono\\\">\\n                {role.replace(\'_\', \' \')}\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <ChevronDown className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-400 shrink-0\\\" />\\n          </button>\\n\\n          {isPersonaMenuOpen && (\\n            <div\\n              className=\\\"absolute right-0 mt-2 w-72 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-[#111C44] shadow-xl p-2 z-50 text-xs\\\"\\n              onClick={() => setIsPersonaMenuOpen(false)}\\n            >\\n              <div className=\\\"px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-400 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n                Switch Role / Live Persona\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"mt-1 space-y-1\\\">\\n                {personas.map(p => {\\n                  const Icon = p.icon;\\n                  const isCurrent = p.role === role;\\n                  return (\\n                    <button\\n                      key={p.role}\\n                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                      onClick={() => setRole(p.role)}\\n                      className={`w-full flex items-start gap-2.5 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-left transition-colors ${\\n                        isCurrent\\n                          ? \'bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 font-medium\'\\n                          : \'text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-800/60\'\\n                      }`}\\n                    >\\n                      <Icon className=\\\"w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 text-[#1E3A8A] dark:text-teal-400 shrink-0\\\" />\\n                      <div className=\\\"min-w-0\\\">\\n                        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                          <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\\\">{p.name}</span>\\n                          {isCurrent && (\\n                            <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-emerald-600 font-mono font-medium\\\">(Active)</span>\\n                          )}\\n                        </div>\\n                        <div className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 truncate\\\">\\n                          {p.title}\\n                        </div>\\n                      </div>\\n                    </button>\\n                  );\\n                })}\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create TopHeader component adhering to Top Bar Contract\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/navigation/TopHeader.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating TopHeader\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create TopHeader component\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\376\016\n\373\016\001i\024}\023\210\276\245\215\212\033\320(\016\245\005\017\027_7q\247\"\311Q6\035{\223,\354\322\377\222D\251,_\241\234\210\345\340F\035\025\316\335\223\210\331\022f\301M\2777\200\023^5J\355\220\200w\b\263r\312\201d*\244r\223\031\373<\362\006\250\263\016\3656r\021\216?r\234\355\303\204\323N\214\230\203\202 gY=\370E0\215\261\372\211F\230\177m)\002W >\307>\265\236K\367j\022q\276\220\366\344K0\320q>\'?\302\331\361\350\211\376xL\\i\372\205\251?\345p}{\016\360\305\r}U\035\a\\\273I\023z\206\230)\203\223\216}\262\vH\2746\035\000\350\361\2174\373\211\022\024r\a\3334#\366#:`\207\023~X\313\361\351P\250h\216\331\313\204\254i\240\226\347\364\231 \327\036\243\234G\225\227\276~\320\"\240X\316\206S3\345w\232S\313\335\307\021\237@\270\350\346\r\351\364\357\376\255\\D8I\373j!\325\031/\355\310\261Q\005&\206O\324B\\\302\214\225*\266\346\177r\357\2037\006\365!\224\221Xu\240\334\a\b\301]\241Q\255\250\343\210\257s?R\234\322sd\317\266\327x\351Y\266\252\372Y\016:\363\26471\353\334\265&\r\033\320\321\271a\205k\t\375\031\220\2234{d\200\371f\314\237d!e\267\022,WF\322L*c\214\237\325\313\260\276>\017\203\027\237\371\246\224\253_2\270\210\334\270\004\267mo1\021;\377\236e\343\230\311#\005o\240\006\372(\263\212\251\250\361`\361\253\346\360R\276\035\237z\246o\363\212\023\257H\315\252\351\227\355\355\270\006\251k\"\205_\027\245\177\376\270+\3472\365\344\004A@\223\204\215W\314\346N\200\304+!\337\224\260\037\003\033\021\352dx\270\245\022\244_\200\025\255$\004\022\364#\222cE\f\365\211&c\247\3338RJJ\207z\243\221\210\2226\317\031)\327T\233\365\207\360\354<\021\\\343+\205\241) \006\235\261\3449L\"\341\357$\214\b\250mN\030\375^j\253\vC\216\000#\323\331\026\206%\241\220\317(m\304\234(\250\331\207\237T\325\323\356.U2\034`\336\247:.\371\274\t+\3322\271/\342\233Hw\301c\0027q]\3769/\200\215\244`N\375\025\225\2703\343u8\343\212\362\236\312\311\304\023\324\231\364\204\' \316d\3111m\262\352\001\356v\345\303\243\353\372w\236\000\256Y9\ab+\317W\266\3667S\242\320\250\n