  planner_response {
    response: "### IMS \342\200\223 Institute Management System (v1.0.0-MVP)\n\nA multi-role Institute Management System designed for enterprise campus administration, academic performance tracking, and classroom operations.\n\n---\n\n### Core Architecture & Capabilities\n\n1. **Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) & Persona Switching**:\n   - **Super Admin (Dr. Arvind Sharma, Chancellor)**: Multi-campus executive governance, scholastic enrollment vs. retention curves, quarterly revenue targets ($2.41M collected), academic health index heatmaps, branch limits, and system audit trail.\n   - **Campus Admin (Rachel Vance, Dean of Operations)**: Operations hub with real-time roll call rates, active cohort gauges, fee receivables, priority at-risk radar flags, student admission wizard, cohort batch transfers, and circular publisher.\n   - **Faculty Lead (Prof. Vikram Nair, Physics & Calculus)**: Instructional workspace with lecture schedule, pending assignment grading queue, daily batch roll call (`FastAttendanceGrid` with keyboard hotkeys **P/A/L** and streak counter), spreadsheet gradebook with live bell-curve distributions, and remediation plan assigner.\n   - **Student (Aarav Patel, Grade 11 STEM Alpha)**: Gamified learning dashboard with active attendance streaks (16 days), badge showcase (XP points), growth trajectory charts vs. cohort averages, homework submitter with document upload, and journey timeline.\n   - **Parent / Guardian (Meera Patel)**: Ward overview with daily attendance consistency heatmap, direct faculty remarks feed, plain-English academic diagnostics, remediation milestone checklist, and online tuition settlement with instant receipt generation.\n\n2. **Performance Diagnostic Engine (`computeStudentDiagnostics`)**:\n   - Attendance deficit triggering ($<75\\%$ baseline and $<60\\%$ critical threshold).\n   - Acute subject contraction detection ($\\ge 15\\%$ drop) and benchmark pass/fail gap analysis.\n   - Automated remediation bridge assignments and study hall recommendations.\n\n3. **Specialized Component Suite**:\n   - `StatCard`: KPI cards with change indicators, trend arrows, and tabular figures.\n   - `PerformanceTrendChart`: Dual-line progression chart comparing individual scores against cohort averages.\n   - `AttendanceHeatmap`: 35-day presence grid with hover states and percentage breakdown.\n   - `FastAttendanceGrid`: Batch roll call interface with hotkeys (`P`, `A`, `L`), mark-all-present, and transit remarks.\n   - `BadgeShowcase`: Milestone and gamification trophy display.\n   - `MobilePreviewModal`: In-app mobile device simulator rendering the specified React Native / Expo screens (`SuperAdminOverviewScreen`, `AdminDashboardScreen`, `TeacherAttendanceScreen`, `StudentPulseScreen`, and `ParentWardProgressScreen`)."
    thinking: "**Verifying Pre-Flight Checklist**\n\nThe build was successful, a good start! Now I\'m carefully reviewing the pre-flight verification checklist, specifically the `frontend-design` considerations. I\'m checking that the SaaS and Dashboard guidelines are correctly applied, especially focusing on clean tabular-nums and single-elevation cards. This is a critical step before moving forward.\n\n\n**Refining Functionality Specs**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into refining the functionality specs. I\'ve detailed handlers for attendance marking, test scheduling, homework submission and grading, fee collection, and remediation plans, including relevant UI toggles and state commits. Key aspects include hotkey integration, bell-curve simulation, PDF attachment simulation, and automated invoice creation. I\'ve also added considerations for persona switching, mobile previews, and dark/light mode toggles.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "### IMS \342\200\223 Institute Management System (v1.0.0-MVP)\n\nA multi-role Institute Management System designed for enterprise campus administration, academic performance tracking, and classroom operations.\n\n---\n\n### Core Architecture & Capabilities\n\n1. **Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) & Persona Switching**:\n   - **Super Admin (Dr. Arvind Sharma, Chancellor)**: Multi-campus executive governance, scholastic enrollment vs. retention curves, quarterly revenue targets ($2.41M collected), academic health index heatmaps, branch limits, and system audit trail.\n   - **Campus Admin (Rachel Vance, Dean of Operations)**: Operations hub with real-time roll call rates, active cohort gauges, fee receivables, priority at-risk radar flags, student admission wizard, cohort batch transfers, and circular publisher.\n   - **Faculty Lead (Prof. Vikram Nair, Physics & Calculus)**: Instructional workspace with lecture schedule, pending assignment grading queue, daily batch roll call (`FastAttendanceGrid` with keyboard hotkeys **P/A/L** and streak counter), spreadsheet gradebook with live bell-curve distributions, and remediation plan assigner.\n   - **Student (Aarav Patel, Grade 11 STEM Alpha)**: Gamified learning dashboard with active attendance streaks (16 days), badge showcase (XP points), growth trajectory charts vs. cohort averages, homework submitter with document upload, and journey timeline.\n   - **Parent / Guardian (Meera Patel)**: Ward overview with daily attendance consistency heatmap, direct faculty remarks feed, plain-English academic diagnostics, remediation milestone checklist, and online tuition settlement with instant receipt generation.\n\n2. **Performance Diagnostic Engine (`computeStudentDiagnostics`)**:\n   - Attendance deficit triggering ($<75\\%$ baseline and $<60\\%$ critical threshold).\n   - Acute subject contraction detection ($\\ge 15\\%$ drop) and benchmark pass/fail gap analysis.\n   - Automated remediation bridge assignments and study hall recommendations.\n\n3. **Specialized Component Suite**:\n   - `StatCard`: KPI cards with change indicators, trend arrows, and tabular figures.\n   - `PerformanceTrendChart`: Dual-line progression chart comparing individual scores against cohort averages.\n   - `AttendanceHeatmap`: 35-day presence grid with hover states and percentage breakdown.\n   - `FastAttendanceGrid`: Batch roll call interface with hotkeys (`P`, `A`, `L`), mark-all-present, and transit remarks.\n   - `BadgeShowcase`: Milestone and gamification trophy display.\n   - `MobilePreviewModal`: In-app mobile device simulator rendering the specified React Native / Expo screens (`SuperAdminOverviewScreen`, `AdminDashboardScreen`, `TeacherAttendanceScreen`, `StudentPulseScreen`, and `ParentWardProgressScreen`)."
    thinking_duration {
