  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Integrating TuitionPro Data**\n\nI\'m now focused on integrating all the data from the TuitionPro HTML file into `/src/data/mockData.ts`. My current focus is ensuring all student, course, batch, exam, fee, attendance, inquiry, material, timetable, substitute, and finance data are meticulously transferred.\n\n\n**Extracting Course Information**\n\nI\'ve begun extracting course information from the HTML data, focusing on the course names, activity status, and batch associations. I am now working on mapping staff data, including their roles and assigned subjects. This ensures the foundational elements for student and batch assignments.\n\n\n**Adding Student Data**\n\nI\'m now integrating individual student data. I\'ve begun populating information for Meera, Rohan, and Sana, including batch, class, parent details, phone numbers, fees, payment status, admission date, and current status. Then, I am going to populate the finance and inquiry data.\n\n**Compiling Financial Transactions**\n\nI am now focusing on consolidating payment information. I\'ve recorded transactions for Aarav, Diya, Meera, and Rohan, capturing amounts, dates, payment modes (UPI, Cash, Bank), and reference numbers. Next, I\'ll incorporate the lead and inquiry data.\n\n**Recording Inquiry Details**\n\nI have started inputting lead and inquiry data. I\'m recording details for Isha Desai, Yash Jain, and Neha Verma, including phone numbers, requested courses (JEE Foundation, Class 10 Boards), lead sources (Walk-in, Call, Website), assigned staff (Admin), follow-up dates, and current statuses (New, Follow-Up).\n\n\n**Adding Inquiry Details**\n\nI\'ve added inquiry data for Arjun Patel, including phone number, course, lead source, and status. I\'ve also recorded exam details for multiple subjects across different batches. Finally, I have updated the timetable details, specifically for Maths and Physics classes, specifying the teacher and the room.\n\n\n**Updating Timetable and Resources**\n\nI\'ve integrated the most recent timetable updates, including classes for Physics, Science, Chemistry, and Maths Problem Clinic across the JEE-1 and 10-A batches. Now I am adding course material like notes, videos, and worksheets, with links to where those resources are hosted.\n\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_911313"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import {\\n  Institute,\\n  User,\\n  TeacherProfile,\\n  StudentProfile,\\n  ParentProfile,\\n  Course,\\n  Subject,\\n  Batch,\\n  TimetableSlot,\\n  AttendanceRecord,\\n  Test,\\n  TestResult,\\n  Homework,\\n  HomeworkSubmission,\\n  FeeInvoice,\\n  FeePayment,\\n  PerformanceAlert,\\n  ImprovementPlan,\\n  StudentRemark,\\n  Notice,\\n  Badge,\\n  AuditLog,\\n  InquiryLead,\\n  StudyMaterial,\\n  PTMMeeting,\\n  FinanceTransaction,\\n  SubstituteAssignment\\n} from \'../types/ims\';\\n\\nexport const mockInstitute: Institute = {\\n  id: \'inst-01\',\\n  name: \'TuitionPro Academy & Coaching Institute\',\\n  code: \'TP-HQ\',\\n  address: \'100 Innovation Boulevard & Education Hub\',\\n  phone: \'+91 98250 10000\',\\n  email: \'admin@tuitionpro.edu\',\\n  logoUrl: \'\',\\n  campusCount: 3,\\n  totalStudents: 120,\\n  totalFaculty: 12\\n};\\n\\nexport const mockUsers: User[] = [\\n  {\\n    id: \'u-admin\',\\n    instituteId: \'inst-01\',\\n    email: \'admin@tuitionpro.edu\',\\n    role: \'ADMIN\',\\n    firstName: \'Director\',\\n    lastName: \'Admin\',\\n    phone: \'+91 98250 00001\',\\n    isActive: true,\\n    title: \'Managing Director & Operations Head\'\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'u-superadmin\',\\n    instituteId: \'inst-01\',\\n    email: \'chancellor@tuitionpro.edu\',\\n    role: \'SUPER_ADMIN\',\\n    firstName: \'Dr. Arvind\',\\n    lastName: \'Sharma\',\\n    phone: \'+91 98250 00002\',\\n    isActive: true,\\n    title: \'Academic Trustee & Chairman\'\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'u-teacher-mehta\',\\n    instituteId: \'inst-01\',\\n    email: \'mehta@tuitionpro.edu\',\\n    role: \'TEACHER\',\\n    firstName: \'Prof.\',\\n    lastName: \'Mehta\',\\n    phone: \'+91 98250 00011\',\\n    isActive: true,\\n    title: \'Senior Faculty \342\200\223 Mathematics\'\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'u-teacher-shah\',\\n    instituteId: \'inst-01\',\\n    email: \'shah@tuitionpro.edu\',\\n    role: \'TEACHER\',\\n    firstName: \'P