  planner_response {
    response: "### TuitionPro & Institute Management System \342\200\224 App Sizing & Complete Data Integration\n\nThe missing modules, datasets, and responsive app viewport requested in the coaching class manager reference have been implemented:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Dedicated App Screen Size Controls\n- **Default Mobile App Frame (390px\342\200\223420px)**: The interface now defaults to a native mobile app viewport with mobile-first card rhythm, safe area spacing, touch-friendly inputs, and horizontal scrolling navigation tabs.\n- **One-Click Screen Sizer**: A persistent device switcher is pinned at the top:\n  - \360\237\223\261 **Mobile App (390px)**: Compact phone container.\n  - \360\237\223\262 **Tablet (780px)**: iPad/tablet format.\n  - \360\237\222\273 **Full Screen**: Fluid desktop view.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Complete Data & Module Coverage (from TuitionPro reference)\n\n1. **Inquiries & Admissions Pipeline (CRM)**:\n   - Tracks prospective leads (`Isha Desai`, `Yash Jain`, `Neha Verma`, `Arjun Patel`) with phone numbers, courses, lead source (`Walk-in`, `Call`, `Website`), assigned staff, follow-up date pickers, and live conversion rate calculation.\n2. **Fee Management & Ledger**:\n   - Complete fee ledger with actual tuition amounts: Class 10 (\342\202\27124,000) and JEE Foundation (\342\202\27136,000).\n   - Real-time balance calculations (`bal = fee - paid`), due dates (`2026-11-05`), partial/overdue statuses, and 1-click **WhatsApp parent reminder** simulation.\n   - Payment recorder supporting **UPI, Cash, Bank Transfer, Card** with reference numbers.\n   - **Official Payment Receipt Modal** displaying student name, date, mode, reference #, and remaining balance.\n3. **Biometric & Classroom Attendance**:\n   - Daily roll call with `P` (Present), `A` (Absent), and `L` (Leave) selectors.\n   - **Biometric Device Import**: Paste device text (e.g. `Aarav,2026-10-24,P`) with duplicate detection and unmatched name logging.\n   - Monthly attendance percentage sheet with CSV/Excel export.\n4. **Timetable with Conflict Detection & Substitute Finder**:\n   - Timetable scheduler with automatic conflict detection across teacher, batch, and classroom slots.\n   - **Teacher Absent Substitute Finder**: Detects affected classes for an absent teacher, filters available faculty by subject, and assigns substitutes with 1-click audit logging.\n5. **Examinations & Gradebook**:\n   - Scheduled unit tests (`Unit Test 1`, `Unit Test 2`, `Physics T1`, `Physics T2`, `Unit Test 3`) with max marks and pass marks.\n   - Marks entry per batch with input validation, grade calculator (`A+` to `F`), pass/fail tags, and admin publish approval toggle.\n6. **Progress Growth Curves**:\n   - Interactive student score progression bar chart with previous vs. current delta indicators.\n   - Cohort summaries showing batch highest, lowest, and average score benchmarks.\n7. **Study Material / Digital Content Library**:\n   - Repository for formula sheets, question banks, and YouTube video lectures with direct link opening and deletion.\n8. **Parent-Teacher Meetings (PTM)**:\n   - Meeting scheduler with date, time, physical hall or Zoom link, and batch filtering.\n9. **Finances & Operating Balance**:\n   - Real-world expense ledger tracking debit categories (`Rent: \342\202\27130,000`, `Salaries: \342\202\27145,000`, `Utilities: \342\202\2714,800`, `Stationery: \342\202\2712,500`) alongside student fee collections.\n   - Automatically computes **Net Operating Balance** (`Collections + Other Credits - Expenses`) with date filtering and CSV export.\n10. **Parent Portal**:\n    - Ward selector (`Aarav`, `Meera`, etc.) with attendance dial, fee balance, published exam report cards, timetable, and circular announcements."
    thinking: "**Verifying Data Integration**\n\nI\'ve confirmed a successful build, with no errors. Now, I\'m meticulously reviewing the user\'s request. Specifically, I\'m focusing on the \"missing data\" concern. To address it, I\'ve integrated all available data from the `TuitionPro__Coaching_Class_Manager_0bb8e5d0.html` file and am proceeding to verify comprehensive coverage.\n\n\n**Analyzing Module Coverage**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into the 15 modules. My focus is on ensuring comprehensive data coverage for each. I\'m carefully analyzing the characteristics of: Dashboard, Students, Inquiries, Fees, Attendance, Timetable, Exams, Marks & Results, Progress, Study Material, Courses & Batches, PTM, and Finance to ensure they are complete. I\'m particularly interested in the CRM leads and pipeline data points.\n\n\n**Examining Student Records**\n\nI\'m now consolidating student data with a granular approach to verify the integrity of financial and academic records. This includes a full roster with fee structures and payment statuses, exam marks, and inquiry details for conversion rates.\n\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "### TuitionPro & Institute Management System \342\200\224 App Sizing & Complete Data Integration\n\nThe missing modules, datasets, and responsive app viewport requested in the coaching class manager reference have been implemented:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Dedicated App Screen Size Controls\n- **Default Mobile App Frame (390px\342\200\223420px)**: The interface now defaults to a native mobile app viewport with mobile-first card rhythm, safe area spacing, touch-friendly inputs, and horizontal scrolling navigation tabs.\n- **One-Click Screen Sizer**: A persistent device switcher is pinned at the top:\n  - \360\237\223\261 **Mobile App (390px)**: Compact phone container.\n  - \360\237\223\262 **Tablet (780px)**: iPad/tablet format.\n  - \360\237\222\273 **Full Screen**: Fluid desktop view.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Complete Data & Module Coverage (from TuitionPro reference)\n\n1. **Inquiries & Admissions Pipeline (CRM)**:\n   - Tracks prospective leads (`Isha Desai`, `Yash Jain`, `Neha Verma`, `Arjun Patel`) with phone numbers, courses, lead source (`Walk-in`, `Call`, `Website`), assigned staff, follow-up date pickers, and live conversion rate calculation.\n2. **Fee Management & Ledger**:\n   - Complete fee ledger with actual tuition amounts: Class 10 (\342\202\27124,000) and JEE Foundation (\342\202\27136,000).\n   - Real-time balance calculations (`bal = fee - paid`), due dates (`2026-11-05`), partial/overdue statuses, and 1-click **WhatsApp parent reminder** simulation.\n   - Payment recorder supporting **UPI, Cash, Bank Transfer, Card** with reference numbers.\n   - **Official Payment Receipt Modal** displaying student name, date, mode, reference #, and remaining balance.\n3. **Biometric & Classroom Attendance**:\n   - Daily roll call with `P` (Present), `A` (Absent), and `L` (Leave) selectors.\n   - **Biometric Device Import**: Paste device text (e.g. `Aarav,2026-10-24,P`) with duplicate detection and unmatched name logging.\n   - Monthly attendance percentage sheet with CSV/Excel export.\n4. **Timetable with Conflict Detection & Substitute Finder**:\n   - Timetable scheduler with automatic conflict detection across teacher, batch, and classroom slots.\n   - **Teacher Absent Substitute Finder**: Detects affected classes for an absent teacher, filters available faculty by subject, and assigns substitutes with 1-click audit logging.\n5. **Examinations & Gradebook**:\n   - Scheduled unit tests (`Unit Test 1`, `Unit Test 2`, `Physics T1`, `Physics T2`, `Unit Test 3`) with max marks and pass marks.\n   - Marks entry per batch with input validation, grade calculator (`A+` to `F`), pass/fail tags, and admin publish approval toggle.\n6. **Progress Growth Curves**:\n   - Interactive student score progression bar chart with previous vs. current delta indicators.\n   - Cohort summaries showing batch highest, lowest, and average score benchmarks.\n7. **Study Material / Digital Content Library**:\n   - Repository for formula sheets, question banks, and YouTube video lectures with direct link opening and deletion.\n8. **Parent-Teacher Meetings (PTM)**:\n   - Meeting scheduler with date, time, physical hall or Zoom link, and batch filtering.\n9. **Finances & Operating Balance**:\n   - Real-world expense ledger tracking debit categories (`Rent: \342\202\27130,000`, `Salaries: \342\202\27145,000`, `Utilities: \342\202\2714,800`, `Stationery: \342\202\2712,500`) alongside student fee collections.\n   - Automatically computes **Net Operating Balance** (`Collections + Other Credits - Expenses`) with date filtering and CSV export.\n10. **Parent Portal**:\n    - Ward selector (`Aarav`, `Meera`, etc.) with attendance dial, fee balance, published exam report cards, timetable, and circular announcements."
