    response: "A visual **Grade Distribution Chart** using Recharts has been added to the **Marks & Results** tab:\n\n### What was added:\n1. **Recharts Interactive Bar Chart**:\n   - **Grade Buckets**: Accurately computes student tallies across all 6 requested grade ranges:\n     - **A+** ($\\ge 90\\%$) \342\200\224 Emerald (`#10b981`)\n     - **A** ($75\\% - 89\\%$) \342\200\224 Forest Green (`#059669`)\n     - **B** ($60\\% - 74\\%$) \342\200\224 Teal (`#0d9488`)\n     - **C** ($45\\% - 59\\%$) \342\200\224 Amber (`#f59e0b`)\n     - **D** ($33\\% - 44\\%$) \342\200\224 Warm Orange (`#ea580c`)\n     - **F** ($< 33\\%$) \342\200\224 Rose (`#dc2626`)\n   - **Custom Tooltip**: Hovering over any bar reveals the grade tier, threshold percentage range, student count, and proportion of evaluated students.\n\n2. **Exam Overview & Quick Badges**:\n   - Above the chart, a cohort pass rate indicator displays the percentage of students meeting passing criteria along with the evaluated ratio (e.g. `12 / 14 Passed`).\n   - A quick summary pill row shows student counts per grade with matching color accents.\n   - Fully reactive: automatically recalibrates when switching exams from the test selector or entering marks via the \"Enter Marks\" modal."
